%% AgroVision - Scan, diagnose, save, outbreak alert.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor F as Farmer
    participant UI as CaptureScreen / ResultScreen
    participant CL as DiagnosisClassifier (TFLite, on device)
    participant DR as DiagnosisRepository
    participant ST as Cloud Storage
    participant FS as Firestore (local cache + cloud)
    participant OD as onDiagnosisCreated
    participant OF as onOutbreakAlertCreated
    participant FCM as FCM
    actor N as Nearby farmers' phones

    F->>UI: Take or pick a leaf photo
    UI->>CL: classify(image)
    Note over CL: No network needed
    CL-->>UI: predictedClass + confidenceScore
    UI-->>F: Show result and advice

    F->>UI: Tap Save
    UI->>DR: save(diagnosis, image, location)
    DR->>FS: write diagnoses/{id} with geohash
    alt Online
        DR->>ST: upload image
        ST-->>DR: imageUrl
        DR->>FS: set imageUrl
    else Offline
        Note over DR,FS: Saved locally by Firestore persistence and synced when back online.<br/>Image upload handling to be confirmed in the integration phase.
    end
    DR-->>UI: saved
    UI-->>F: Added to History

    FS->>OD: trigger: diagnoses/{id} created
    OD->>FS: query same disease within OUTBREAK_RADIUS_KM and OUTBREAK_WINDOW_HOURS (geohash)
    alt reports >= OUTBREAK_MIN_REPORTS
        OD->>FS: create or update outbreakAlerts (disease, rounded centre, radius, count, steps)
        Note over OD,FS: No userId and no exact position stored in the alert
        FS->>OF: trigger: outbreakAlerts/{id} created
        OF->>FS: find users inside radius, read fcmToken
        OF->>FS: write notifications (userId, alertId, title, body, deliveryStatus)
        OF->>FCM: send push to tokens
        FCM-->>N: Notification: outbreak near you
        OF->>FS: update deliveryStatus
        N->>FS: AlertsScreen watchNearby, markRead
    else below threshold
        Note over OD: No alert created
    end
